      },
      "text": "TYPE 1: CONCEPTUAL FOUNDATION\n  Identified a new category that reorganized everything.\n  Not just \"ahead of their time\" but \"created a new time.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#005",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
