        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Visionaries - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Shannon (1948):  Information has a mathematically precise\n                   definition; transmission has fundamental limits\n  Turing (1936):   Universal computation; the halting problem\n  Von Neumann:     Cellular automata; self-replicating systems\n  Wiener:          Feedback as the unifying concept across biology,\n                   engineering, and social systems"
    },
