      "text": "More (Utopia, 1516): State-managed property + leisure\n  Bellamy (Looking Backward, 1888): Technocratic socialism\n  Wells (A Modern Utopia, 1905): World state\n  Saint-Simon: Government of experts replacing hereditary aristocracy"
    },
