      "text": "TURING (1936-1954):\n  \"On Computable Numbers\" (1936) — universal Turing machine;\n  Church-Turing thesis; halting problem; computability\n  Turing test (1950) — behavioral criterion for intelligence\n  Morphogenesis (1952) — reaction-diffusion; biological pattern\n  formation through chemical gradients"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#018",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
