        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "visionaries",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Visionaries - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "You know the computation theory deeply. What may be less\n  familiar: Turing's biological morphogenesis paper was a\n  genuine mathematical biology contribution (reaction-diffusion\n  equations) that was confirmed experimentally only in 2012.\n  He was 58 years ahead of experimental confirmation."
    },
