        "title": "Visionaries - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SHANNON (1948):\n  \"A Mathematical Theory of Communication\" — entropy; channel\n  capacity; source coding; error-correcting codes\n  This is information theory. You know this.\n  What's in the visionaries directory: Shannon as a\n  *complete thinker* — his thesaurus machine (mechanical\n  word associations, 1951), his maze-solving mouse, his\n  juggling machines — the playfulness was not incidental;\n  it connected the same formalism to different domains."
    }
